<SPT><TTL>Pressure Control Valve (PCV)</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>The PCV must be connected to I/O-1, I/O-2 and UPS#3 as indicated on the Terminal Block Connection drawing. The 
graphical display enabled and closed lights and screen number 2 status must activate based on the PLC's output 
