         <CEL MERGEACROSS="2" STYLEID="s50">
<DTA TYPE="STRING">A number inside braces, {x}, in the following paragraphs indicates that the number may be changed by the operator via the operator interface within the Set Point Range listed above.</DTA>
         </CEL>
